This file is used to project via VGA an image from the UACJ siglas it has a size below 160x 100, in case you want to add more datails, it work using simple modules and 
 Each letter is then assigned a specific X coordinate by adding multiples of the spacing value to the starting X: U at 100, A at 155, C at 210, 
J at 265, a blank space at 320, the first I at 375, the second I at 430, and T at 485, while all letters share the same Y coordinate of 215. For every pixel generated by the VGA controller

All the code is documented has notes in every step in case you want to make any changes.
